  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Despite ambitious environmental and climate objectives, Lao PDR remains vulnerable to theimpacts of the Triple Planetary Crisis and reliant on a growth model dependent on naturalresource use. Recent economic and financial difficulties resulting from external and domesticfactors have exacerbated the gap between Lao PDR&#x2019;s ambitious environmental policy andresources available to implement this agenda. As recognised by the Government of Lao PDR anddevelopment partners at February 2024 Roundtable Imp</narrative>
  </description>
